    "sylid": 872,
    "subjectCode": "DBD301",
    "syllabusName": "Advanced Databases_Cơ sở dữ liệu nâng cao",
    "syllabusEnglish": null,
    "credits": "3",
    "degreeLevel": "Bachelor",
    "timeAllocation": "Contact time: 30 sessions; 1 session = 90'\n\nLectures:\n\nTutorials:",
    "prerequisite": "DBI201/DBI202",
    "description": "The course is to provide students with some most advantage knowledge in DataBase field:\n\n- Conceptual Database Design (review)\n\n- Methodology – Logical Database Design for the Relational Model (review)\n\n- Methodology – Physical Database Design for Relational Databases (review)\n\n- Distributed DBMSs – Concepts and Design\n\n- Overview of Networking\n\n- Functions and Architectures of a Distributed DBMSs\n\n- Object-Oriented DBMSs – Concepts and Design\n\n- Weakness of Relational DBMSs\n\n- Storing Objects in a Relational Database\n\n- Issues in Object Oriented DBMSs\n\n- Advantages and Disadvantages of Object Oriented DBMSs\n\n- Object Data Standard ODMG 3.0\n\n- Object-Relational DBMSs\n\n- Security and Administration\n\n- Transaction Management\n\n- Query Processing\n\n- Introduce to Data mining and Data Warehousing\n\nThis course will also first step introduce to students using Oracle (10g version) like DBMS on work.",
    "studentTasks": "- Students must attend more than 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.\n\n'- Student is responsible to do all exercises and qiuz given by lecturer in class or at home and submit on time.\n\n- Constantly follow announcements on intranet/CMS at http://cms.fpt.edu.vn for up-to-date course information.",
    "tools": "Oracle (Version 10g) hoặc SQL Server",
